WEBVTT

00:04:29.839 --> 00:04:34.887
Hilo tatizo linalosababishwa

00:04:34.911 --> 00:04:38.177
na kampuni, linamaafa ulimwenguni,
hadi ikawa swala la mkataba wa UN?

00:04:38.974 --> 00:04:41.093
"Ndio" ndilo jibu kwa tumbaku.

00:04:41.117 --> 00:04:44.101
Kwa kweli kuna mkata ba UN wa tumbaku

00:04:44.125 --> 00:04:47.551
ambao umethibitishw na nchi 180.

00:04:48.215 --> 00:04:49.922
Mkataba uliundwa

00:04:49.946 --> 00:04:53.613
kwa sababu ya janga

00:04:54.192 --> 00:04:58.236
la maafa ya tumbaku.
Utabili wa sasa ni kuwa

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:02.650
ulimwengu unaelekea, 
idadi ya bilioni moja ya